#! tui-mockup 1
#! size: 120x30
#! caps: attrs=bold,dim,italic,underline,inverse colors=truecolor glyphs=unicode source=docs
#! title: osi — signal view
#! state: normal
#! theme: catppuccin-mocha
#! note: data: osi-spike/demo/run2 (events.jsonl, state.json), frozen 3.62 s after run_start; cof 0.1.0 + scripted adapter, so prompts finish instantly and tokens arrive as bursts
#! note: invented: nothing. ETA reads — because this document has no run history
#! note: craft-ok CR6 a 14-effect demo run leaves rows free; a real run fills them
